BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-0-20261204T2130@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T135700Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T230000
SUMMARY:Late dinner: Mangrove or Thai in
DESCRIPTION:Mangrove is Jamaican food and a cocktail bar downtown\, 103 NW 1st Ave. The kitchen is open until 11:45 on Fridays. Or we order Thai and eat at the house. We’ll decide on the day.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-1-20261205T1000@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T135700Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T113000
SUMMARY:Breakfast at Libertino Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Wynwood\, 2659 NW 2nd Ave. Good coffee\, milk bread sandwiches and waffles. A slow start.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-2-20261205T1130@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T135700Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T133000
SUMMARY:Galleries
DESCRIPTION:Wynwood and the Design District. ICA Miami is free. Superblue is $42 if you want it. Book a time.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-3-20261205T1330@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T135700Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T140000
SUMMARY:Water taxi to the fair
DESCRIPTION:Free. Boats leave the Venetian Marina\, 1635 N Bayshore Dr\, every 7–9 minutes for Maurice Gibb Park in Miami Beach. A free shuttle goes from there to the fair.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-4-20261205T1400@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T135700Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T183000
SUMMARY:Art Basel Miami Beach
DESCRIPTION:Miami Beach Convention Center\, open until 6. Day ticket $92. This is the only ticket we need.
END:VEVENT
